                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Catch errors in loadStructuredData by @Hixie in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/130748">130748</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Update app_builder_test.dart for M3 by @bleroux in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/130794">130794</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Move TapAndDragGestureRecognizer code under gestures by @tgucio in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/119508">119508</a>
